Z||000008||Spyder||07-05-2000||09:19 PM||||Giallo Modena (Glasurit FER 102)<BR>Also known as "Fly Yellow." Some Ferraristi maintain that the "FLY" stands for "Ferrari Light Yellow." A stunning yellow that demands to be noticed. Named for the region in Italy where Enzo Ferrari grew up, Modena. Not coincidentally, that region's official color is yellow. ||||reg||1
