Z||000012||Robert||07-06-2000||12:42 AM||||Yellow?   Did someone say something about yellow?<P>Just a word of advice..... Yellow shows ALL the dirt and rock chips.  If you go with yellow, you will be required to wash your car every three days.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/H87fiero_2.jpg"> <P>||||reg||10
Z||000013||80's BOY||07-06-2000||09:23 AM||||also get ready for alot of painting. since yellow is a neutral color, it took me 13 coats over white primer to get good coverage. lots of time in the ol' paint booth.||||reg||6
